Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.13,0:00:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}人类们
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.00,0:00:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}你们好
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.55,0:00:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}我是人们所说的女淫魔
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.85,0:00:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}让男性沉迷其中
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.80,0:00:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}我是女淫魔哟
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.57,0:00:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}顺便说明一下
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.15,0:01:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}女淫魔可以让时间停止哦
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.22,0:01:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}这就是女淫魔的超能力
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.91,0:01:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}时间停止后就可以让精子射出来
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.55,0:01:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}对方什么都做不了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.82,0:01:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}很棒哟
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.72,0:01:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}但是我很喜欢人类
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.85,0:01:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}看着他 让他兴奋起来
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.82,0:01:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}还有我很喜欢精子哦
Dialogue: 2,0:01:46.25,0:01:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}我想说的
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.25,0:01:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}就是怀孕
Dialogue: 2,0:01:55.02,0:02:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}我要开始了 大家注意咯
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.63,0:02:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}所以
Dialogue: 2,0:02:28.32,0:02:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}喂
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.70,0:02:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}上次说旅游的事儿
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.37,0:02:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}你考虑了吗
Dialogue: 2,0:02:34.30,0:02:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}这个明天就要交了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:43.23,0:02:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}新婚旅行后我们两就再也没去过哪儿了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:48.17,0:02:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}偶尔去玩一下嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:02:51.47,0:02:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}等一下
Dialogue: 2,0:02:55.33,0:03:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}我知道你很忙我想要孩子
Dialogue: 2,0:03:05.47,0:03:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}待会儿吧
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.20,0:03:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}我在认真跟你说呢
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.67,0:03:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}妈妈已经在催了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:19.50,0:03:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}我知道啦
Dialogue: 2,0:03:22.57,0:03:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}待会儿吧
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.07,0:03:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}等一下 干嘛呀
Dialogue: 2,0:03:31.05,0:03:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}不要工作了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:34.12,0:03:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}不要呀 我还要工作
Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.13,0:03:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}摸我吧
